***acceptance tests***

# check-without-file
`plain-parser check` without a file exits with code 2 and writes `usage:` on standard error.

# parse-without-file
`plain-parser parse` without a file exits with code 2, writes `usage:` on standard error and nothing on standard output.

# without-subcommand
`plain-parser` without arguments exits with code 2.
